# variants/kits/tools/toolbox — the ISO tools, installed only in the toolbox stage
#
# LEAF set. shidashi assemble runs them in the toolbox container (shidashi/toolbox.py):
# grub-mkrescue drives xorriso (libisoburn) and builds the EFI image with mtools.
# mksquashfs and unsquashfs come with @base (kits/core/fs: sys-fs/squashfs-tools).
#
# The boot test too (story 024): on a node without QEMU (the slim worker) the whole boot
# test runs in a podman container imported from the v3-systemd toolbox
# (shidashi/vmrunner.py). qemu brings qemu-system-x86_64 and its OVMF; openssh brings
# ssh and ssh-keygen; systemd-ssh-proxy comes with the stage3's systemd. No virtiofsd:
# a boot test passes no shares.

sys-boot/grub
dev-libs/libisoburn
sys-fs/mtools
app-emulation/qemu
net-misc/openssh
